# Git commits

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by`, `Co-Authored-By`, or any AI/Cursor/Claude contributor trailers to commit messages.
- All commits should list only **Rohan Chavan** as author.
- Use `git commit --no-verify` only when a hook incorrectly injects co-author lines and the user has asked to remove them.
